Subject: [PATCH 13/13] feat(backend): add the finance tables (months, incomes,
 items, cards, merge dismissals)

apps/finance: five tables with CHECK constraints, composite (id, user_id)
foreign keys so a card can never join another user's month or item, SQL
delete rules, RLS lock-down, OWNER_FIELD on every model, and item name keys
that follow D-056/D-057. No API endpoints. 150 new tests (324 in total).

Decisions: D-093 and D-097 approved by the user; new AI choices D-103..D-107.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
